msgid "Hi! I'm here in this project's context. Chat normally or ask me to create a task, comment on an issue, move status, or dispatch Codex work."
msgstr "Hi! I'm here in this project's context. Chat normally or ask me to create a task, comment on an issue, move status, or dispatch Codex work."

msgid "I used to treat free text as issue search, which felt robotic. Conversational messages stay in chat now; I only call tools when you ask for an action or explicit search."
msgstr "I used to treat free text as issue search, which felt robotic. Conversational messages stay in chat now; I only call tools when you ask for an action or explicit search."

msgid "Got it. I can chat about the project and call tracker tools when you ask for something concrete — create a task, comment, move status, list issues, or dispatch Codex."
msgstr "Got it. I can chat about the project and call tracker tools when you ask for something concrete — create a task, comment, move status, list issues, or dispatch Codex."

